I don't think this is a very good idea.  It is, at best, a YAFM (which
would work well as who actually greases their wands of lightning?).

Instead, maybe lightning should act more like lightning and hit
adjacent monsters as well as the ones in the zapper's straight LOS.
Lightning moving only in a straight line even when there are
surrounding monsters is just unrealistic.  It makes no sense as it
doesn't represent the behavior of electricity at all.



